.Sh HISTORY
The OpenSSL CMP support was added in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
.Xr OSSL_CMP_get1_caCerts 3
and
.Xr OSSL_CMP_get1_rootCaKeyUpdate 3
were added in OpenSSL 3.2.
.Pp
Support for delayed delivery of all types of response messages was added
in OpenSSL 3.3.
.Pp
.Xr OSSL_CMP_get1_crlUpdate 3
and
.Xr OSSL_CMP_get1_certReqTemplate 3
were added in OpenSSL 3.4.
